 bending elasticity.</article-title><source>Biophys J</source><volume>73</volume><fpage>267</fpage><lpage>276</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">9199791</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004255-Kooijman1"><label>18</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Kooijman</surname><given-names>EE</given-names></name><name><surname>Chupin</surname><given-names>V</given-names></name><name><surname>Fuller</surname><given-names>NL</given-names></name><name><surname>Kozlov</surname><given-names>MM</given-names></name><name><surname>de Kruijff</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Spontaneous curvature of phosphatidic acid and lysophosphatidic acid.</article-title><source>Biochemistry</source><volume>44</volume><fpage>2097</fpage><lpage>2102</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15697235</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004255-Coorssen1"><label>19</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Coorssen</surname><given-names>JR</given-names></name><name><surname>Rand</surname><given-names>RP</given-names></name></person-group><year>1990</year><article-title>Effects of cholesterol on the structural transitions induced by diacylglycerol in phosphatidylcholine and phosphatidylethanolamine bilayer systems.</article-title><source>Biochem Cell Biol</source><volume>68</volume><fpage>65</fpage><lpage>69</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2350502</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0004255-Churchward2"><label>20</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Churchward</surname><given-names>MA</given-names></name><name><surname>Rogasevskaia</surname><given-names>T</given-names></name><name><surname>Brandman</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Khosravani</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Nava</surname><given-names>P</giv